  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/P1210772.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(4 fotos) Profesorado, alumnado y personal de administraci&oacute;n y servicios del IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; de Onda han donado sangre este martes, en el sal&oacute;n de actos del centro, para aumentar las reservas del&nbsp;Centro de Transfusiones&nbsp;de la Comunitat Valenciana.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/donaciosangiesonda101115/p1210770.jpg\" alt=\"p1210770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/donaciosangiesonda101115/p1210771.jpg\" alt=\"p1210771\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/donaciosangiesonda101115/p1210772.jpg\" alt=\"p1210772\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/donaciosangiesonda101115/p1210773.jpg\" alt=\"p1210773\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
